Package: drivemirror
Version: 0.3.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Israel Guido <israelguido@gmail.com>
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libgtk4-layer-shell0, rclone, xdg-desktop-portal
Description: Mirror a local folder to a private rclone remote
 DriveMirror runs rclone sync manually or on a configurable timer and stays
 available through a StatusNotifierItem tray menu.

